        {
          "end_ms": null,
          "error": null,
          "field": "description",
          "page_id": "page-c0e78f3698e7c74a1071a988",
          "qa_findings": [],
          "review_status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "segment_id": "seg-ddeaac391b4d7d6dec3f69c7",
          "segment_index": 13,
          "source_segment_id": "seg-ddeaac391b4d7d6dec3f69c7",
          "source_text_sha256": "c7c81cd584b8cd9809d06f97c45d3c7dee3781aad1f09d358d9d22d5d4bfba32",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On December 21, 2018, between 6:55 PM and 7:00 PM, a driver was surprised to see 5 or 6 glowing objects moving silently in the sky. The witness draws one of the PAN she quickly saw in the sky and completes her report with an image and a newspaper article about the phenomenon. Only one testimony is collected. The vast majority of the elements provided by the witness remain consistent with the hypothesis of an observation of a group of celestial lanterns, specifically: - The reddish color with the presence around each element of a halo of the same color - The ball-shaped form of each element - The number: 5 or 6, the lanterns being released in groups - The absence of perceived noise - The observation duration of 10 minutes, compatible with the life span of the lanterns, which can last up to approximately 20 minutes - The movement, from west to east, either in the direction of the dominant wind at ground level or nearby (see wind map). We also know, via a local press article, that such a release was conducted at the time of the observation in tribute to one of the Villeneuve-sur-Lot yellow vest spokespersons who had passed away the previous day (see article: \"Insolite: qui a vu les ovnis au-dessus de Villeneuve-sur-Lot?\" [Strange: Who Saw the UFOs Over Villeneuve-sur-Lot?]). The only strangeness is that of a \"tube\" or \"neon\" connecting the balls to each other, two by two. It may be a LED light rope. Case classification B: Very probable observation of sky lanterns.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "ff04a9954eebb66068085f2258a6fd1597777e40f982ddee324cad7a1f957e3c"
        }
      ],
